{"availability":"available","full":"indranilnnd-creator/amazing-3d-animated-website-creator","name":"amazing-3d-animated-website-creator","description":"Turn a video + 3D model into a scroll-driven cinematic website: a fullscreen film scrubs with scroll, a Blender/Three.js hero, GSAP ScrollTrigger. Ships an original CC0 demo film + 3D model and an AI-agent skill.","category":"Design","language":"JavaScript","stars":1,"forks":0,"created":"2026-09-26T04:58:21Z","updated":"2026-09-26T06:54:43Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://indranilnnd-creator.github.io/amazing-3d-animated-website-creator/","topics":["apple-style","blender","creative-coding","gltf","gsap","javascript","landing-page","lenis","scroll-animation","scrolltrigger","scrollytelling","threejs","video-scrubbing","webgl"],"demo":"https://indranilnnd-creator.github.io/amazing-3d-animated-website-creator/","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-18T03:01:37.790Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-18T03:01:37.790Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-18T03:01:37.790Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-08T16:07:29.216Z","stars":1,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-11T22:40:23.697Z","stars":1,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-18T03:01:37.790Z","stars":1,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Three.js"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Turn a video and a 3D model into a scroll-driven cinematic landing page — the whole page is the timeline.","Live demo · Quick start · Requirements · How it works · AI-agent skill","Scroll down → the film plays forward. Scroll up → it reverses, frame-perfect. A 3D object stays centered and choreographed to the same clock. Big typography carries the story. Apple/Stripe-grade motion, in plain HTML/CSS/JS."],"features":["A template — drop in your own video + 3D model and you have a cinematic scroll site.","An AI-agent skill (skill/) — the complete, model-agnostic playbook that builds one of these from scratch: discovery interview, asset pipeline, implementation, and browser verification.","🎬 Scroll-scrubbed video background — currentTime = pageProgress × duration; forward on scroll-down, cleanly reversible on scroll-up. No play(), no loop, no stutter.","🧊 Real 3D hero — any Blender object exported to glTF, lit with image-based lighting and PBR, kept centered in a fixed layer while the page scrolls beneath it.","🖤 Black-proof film rendering — the video is only a decoder; a canvas draws each frame and holds the last good frame, so the background can never flash black (a failure mode of bare scrubbing)."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/indranilnnd-creator/amazing-3d-animated-website-creator/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"5080d343a585b4abcbeb6b82e5ba91c5d8475c267e5cb8ae04ebc0fd06ef3638","extractedAt":"2026-10-08T16:07:29.326Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T22:40:23.846Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Turn a video and a 3D model into a scroll-driven cinematic landing page — the whole page is the timeline.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/indranilnnd-creator/amazing-3d-animated-website-creator/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"5080d343a585b4abcbeb6b82e5ba91c5d8475c267e5cb8ae04ebc0fd06ef3638","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/indranilnnd-creator/amazing-3d-animated-website-creator/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-11T22:40:23.846Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-09-26T06:54:43Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/indranilnnd-creator/amazing-3d-animated-website-creator/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-11T22:40:23.847Z","hash":"5080d343a585b4abcbeb6b82e5ba91c5d8475c267e5cb8ae04ebc0fd06ef3638","originalBytes":12188,"storedBytes":12188,"truncated":false},"lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T22:40:23.697Z","subjects":["Animation & motion","MCP servers & agents","3D & graphics"],"platforms":[],"classification":{"version":4,"method":"local_rules","category":"Design","subjects":["Animation & motion","MCP servers & agents","3D & graphics"],"